import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const d=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 161 | Realm Refinement · Origin Realm · Planetary and Cosmic Beings Promotion Logic","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 161 | Realm Refinement · Origin Realm · Planetary and Cosmic Beings Promotion Logic","no":161,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Origin Realm","Planetary Consciousness","Cosmic Beings","Plane Transcendent","Promotion Logic"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","17-Plane Transcendent Standard","53-Exotic Life Recognition Standard"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0161_模块1-本源境-星球级宇宙生灵晋升.md","filePath":"en/0161_模块1-本源境-星球级宇宙生灵晋升.md"}'),a={name:"en/0161_模块1-本源境-星球级宇宙生灵晋升.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,u,h){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-161-origin-realm-promotion-logic-for-planetary-life-and-cosmic-beings" tabindex="-1">Entry 161 | Origin Realm: Promotion Logic for Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-161-origin-realm-promotion-logic-for-planetary-life-and-cosmic-beings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 161 | Origin Realm: Promotion Logic for Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 17, 53</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-a-planet-itself-becomes-a-plane-transcendent" tabindex="-1">Introduction: When a planet itself becomes a &quot;Plane Transcendent&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-a-planet-itself-becomes-a-plane-transcendent" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: When a planet itself becomes a &quot;Plane Transcendent&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>At the apex of Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s nine-realm system, the Origin Realm is, per the Plane Transcendent Standard (Document 17), the Plane Transcendent threshold. For individual cultivators, this means &quot;power sufficient to independently support a plane&#39;s law stability&quot;; for <strong>planetary consciousness and cosmic beings</strong>, the answer is near self-evident — its body is itself a cosmic region. The question is no longer &quot;whether it is enough to support a plane,&quot; but &quot;how it grows from &#39;a plane&#39; into &#39;a cosmic-level being participating in the entire cosmos&#39; law fine-tuning.&#39;&quot; This entry explains the promotion logic of such giant life in the Origin Realm.</p><p>The six top-level axioms running through the text are pushed to the cosmic-mother scale here: the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires planetary consciousness to be a qualified cosmic-level governance subject; the anti-predation axiom forbids it from growing by swallowing neighboring cosmoses; the collective ascension axiom requires it to use itself as a vessel to uplift billions of beings; causal self-discipline and law-first constrain its cosmic-level law participation from tearing structure. Per Exotic Life Recognition Standard (Document 53) and Document 17, unfolding giant life&#39;s origin path. Among them, Article 6 the universal equal infinite law establishes the origin logic that all beings inherently possess basic infinite power, and predation loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-promotion-logic-from-gestator-to-co-author-of-cosmic-laws" tabindex="-1">I. Promotion Logic: From &quot;Gestator&quot; to &quot;Co-Author of Cosmic Laws&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-promotion-logic-from-gestator-to-co-author-of-cosmic-laws" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Promotion Logic: From &quot;Gestator&quot; to &quot;Co-Author of Cosmic Laws&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After planetary-level beings learned cross-boundary in the Boundary-Breaking Realm (Entry 147) and gestation in the World-Creation Realm (Entry 154), the chain for pushing the Origin Realm:</p><ol><li><strong>It is itself a plane</strong>: planetary consciousness/cosmic being&#39;s body is itself a stable plane, naturally meeting the Plane Transcendent&#39;s &quot;independently supporting plane laws&quot; power threshold</li><li><strong>Origin coupling</strong>: rising from &quot;being a cosmic region itself&quot; to &quot;deeply connecting with the entire cosmos&#39; origin,&quot; understanding the cosmos&#39; ultimate operating laws</li><li><strong>Cosmic-level law participation</strong>: using itself as a vessel, participating in cosmic-scale law fine-tuning — the way it fine-tunes laws is letting its own cosmic region&#39;s operational experience feed back to the entire cosmos</li><li><strong>Four-dimensional assessment</strong>: as giant life, it must also pass power, mind, contribution, responsibility four dimensions — only the assessment questions are fully customized to its scale</li></ol><p>For planetary consciousness, individual standards like &quot;energy purity 99%, plane-level total, instant recovery&quot; correspond to the self-consistency of its own law domain and energy cycle efficiency; &quot;life imprint anchored to origin, near-immortal&quot; corresponds to its permanent binding with cosmic origin.</p><h2 id="ii-unique-pain-points-and-costs" tabindex="-1">II. Unique Pain Points and Costs <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-unique-pain-points-and-costs" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Unique Pain Points and Costs&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Giant life pushing origin costs are astonishing in scale:</p><ul><li><strong>Cosmic-scale self-consistency pressure</strong>: it itself is part of the laws, any internal law oscillation directly manifests as a cosmic-level event</li><li><strong>Beings bound</strong>: it and the billions of beings it carries share a completely unified fate; if origin coupling fails, beings and it lose together</li><li><strong>Eons-lonely mind assessment</strong>: can giant life with geological-time thinking pass individual-scale &quot;ethics review and situational stress test&quot; is a unique problem — requires Alaya time bridging to translate its thinking rhythm to assessors</li><li><strong>Behemoth temptation</strong>: eons of accumulation easily slide it toward the &quot;I am the cosmos&quot; behemoth mindset, the ultimate form of the predatory worldview</li></ul><p>The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision imposes <strong>Anchor Council highest-level guardianship</strong> on giant origin candidates, with multiple human Transcendents coordinating with it to complete assessment — this is both protection for it and protection for beings.</p><h2 id="iii-coordination-with-individual-transcendents-nested-gatekeepers" tabindex="-1">III. Coordination with Individual Transcendents: Nested Gatekeepers <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-coordination-with-individual-transcendents-nested-gatekeepers" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Coordination with Individual Transcendents: Nested Gatekeepers&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After planetary-level beings become Origin Realm Transcendents, they never walk alone:</p><ul><li>Using its own cosmic region as a &quot;fulcrum,&quot; it supports the entire cosmos&#39; law stability</li><li>Individual Transcendents (Entries 157, 158) coordinate with it; individuals handle micro law fine-tuning, it handles cosmic-region-level balance</li><li>The billions of beings it carries access the Myriad Races origin two-way circulation through it, enjoying cosmic-level guardianship</li></ul><p>This &quot;giant mother body–individual gatekeeper&quot; nested structure is precisely the three-dimensional implementation of the collective ascension axiom at the cosmos&#39; apex.</p><h2 id="iv-breakthrough-features-from-gestation-type-cosmic-mother-to-cosmic-level-gatekeeper" tabindex="-1">IV. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;Gestation-Type Cosmic Mother&quot; to &quot;Cosmic-Level Gatekeeper&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-breakthrough-features-from-gestation-type-cosmic-mother-to-cosmic-level-gatekeeper" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;Gestation-Type Cosmic Mother&quot; to &quot;Cosmic-Level Gatekeeper&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Markers for planetary-level beings who pass the four-dimensional assessment and formally become Plane Transcendents:</p><ul><li>Its own cosmic region stable and self-consistent, independently supporting a plane</li><li>Deeply connected to cosmic origin, can participate in cosmic law fine-tuning</li><li>Mind dimension confirms &quot;guarding billions of beings&quot; not &quot;behemoth-style monopoly&quot;</li><li>Responsibility dimension accepts cosmic-level public responsibility, becoming a giant node of the anchor network</li></ul><p>Giant life reaching this step already stands at the Origin Realm apex, gazing toward the higher Multiverse Realm (from Entry 164) — crossing a single cosmos, governing multiple cosmoses&#39; origins.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: converting giant life&#39;s eons of evolutionary accumulation into cosmic-level law stability power, not letting it sleep or run amok</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the cosmic mother&#39;s origin growth relies on self-consistency and gestation, absolutely not on swallowing neighboring cosmoses — this is the fundamental negation of the predatory cosmic behemoth</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: old-system cosmic behemoths were either slain and refined by the protagonist, or monopolized alone; Heng Yuan Zhou planetary consciousness becomes a cosmic gatekeeper through four-dimensional assessment</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: planetary consciousness and cosmic origin bodies are explicitly included in the Plane Transcendent sequence; &quot;paths for all stars&quot; extends to &quot;paths for all cosmoses&quot;</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: giant life&#39;s origin experience is relayed back network-wide, directly providing cosmic-level samples for Multiverse Realm cross-cosmos governance</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When a conscious planet itself passes the four-dimensional assessment and becomes a Plane Transcendent, the cosmos gains one of its sturdiest gatekeepers. It need not leave home, because its home is itself a cornerstone of cosmic laws. Planetary-level beings&#39; origin path ultimately proves: the cosmos&#39; stability does not rely on any one hero, but on countless self-consistent cornerstones mutually upholding each other.</p><p>In the final analysis, the Origin Realm planetary and cosmic being promotion described in this document is no isolated case — always pointing toward the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s co-building direction; law self-consistency is backstopped by the law-first axiom, not drifting with narrative convenience.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standard</a> · <a href="./53-奇特生命识别标准.html">53-Exotic Life Recognition Standard</a> · <a href="./23-20%激活战略规划.html">23-20% Activation Strategy</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const g=i(a,[["render",s]]);export{d as __pageData,g as default};
